HackerRig
=========

This product includes data derived from the Hacker News dataset
"open-index/hacker-news", available at:

    https://huggingface.co/datasets/open-index/hacker-news

The source data is licensed under the Open Data Commons Attribution
License (ODC-By) v1.0. A copy of the license is available at:

    https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/by/1.0/

Required attribution:
    Hacker News data from open-index/hacker-news (ODC-By).
    https://huggingface.co/datasets/open-index/hacker-news

Notes:
- Only the 2026-01 through 2026-08-22 monthly shards were used; the source
  data was read-only and is not modified or redistributed in raw form here.
- The aggregated measurements, summaries, and statistics in this repository
  are a derivative compilation of the source data and are provided under the
  same ODC-By attribution terms.
- Original Hacker News comments remain the property of their respective
  authors. Public usernames and comment text are included as attribution
  and source context, consistent with ODC-By.
